## Per-category test detail

### Isolation tests

Tests assert "X CANNOT happen" — proving negatives. Universal tests apply regardless of mechanism; mechanism-specific isolation tests target the specific primitive (RLS policy, schema search_path, cell routing).

| id | name | applies_to | universal | severity | evidence_signature | traceable_to |
