{{/each}}

### Noisy-neighbor tests

Tests assert SLA preservation under abnormal-tenant-load. Severity per-tenant-tier comes from tier-model upstream (enterprise: must-have; mid: should-have; entry: nice-to-have) or uniform `should-have` when tier-model absent.

