Cache-key collision attacks (KV/CDN cache poisoning across tenants) belong in P5 ai's `design-model-cache-isolation` skill. At this wave the catalogue's `must_have: 0` for this category is a deliberate forward-trace placeholder; should-have / nice-to-have entries are aspirational.

